WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.600
Record once. Keep the whole story.
Meet Handover, your workspace for clearer handovers.

00:04.600 --> 00:12.000
Capture a screen video, or use the browser
recorder for searchable walkthroughs.

00:12.000 --> 00:19.000
Replay the flow, and put context at the exact
moment with timestamp notes.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.500
Review captured text and unwanted
sections before sharing.

00:24.500 --> 00:28.000
Your recordings start private.

00:28.000 --> 00:34.000
Create a viewer link only when you are ready,
and revoke it whenever you need.

00:34.000 --> 00:39.500
Keep everything together with
projects, guides and collections.

00:39.500 --> 00:44.000
Handover Studio.
Every handover, one clear answer.
